/*
 * Implements validation and construction of character literal values.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - escape-sequence processing,
 *   - UTF-8, UTF-16, and UTF-32 character encodings,
 *   - suffix-based selection of the output character width,
 *   - and validation that the literal represents exactly one code unit
 *     in the chosen encoding.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::literal::char
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/literal/char.yr
